   "period": "2025-12-31",
   "accession": "0001104659-26-014731",
   "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/927003/000110465926014731/aeis-20251231x10k.htm"
  },
  "description_short": "Advanced Energy (Nasdaq: AEIS) is a global leader in the design and manufacturing of highly engineered, precision power conversion, measurement, and control solutions for mission-critical applications and processes. AE's power solutions enable customer innovation in complex applications for a wide range of industries including semiconductor equipment, industrial, manufacturing, telecommunications, data center computing, and healthcare. With engineering know-how and responsive worldwide service and support, the company builds collaborative partnerships to meet evolving technology requirements, drive customer growth, and innovate the future of power.",
